# Create Page Workflow

## Page Creation Checklist

### 1. File Structure Pattern
- **Page**: `src/pages/PageNamePage.jsx` (minimal, delegates to container)
- **Container**: `src/containers/PageNameContainer.jsx` (business logic, API, Redux)
- **Components**: `src/components/PageNameComponent.jsx` (UI only, props-based)
- **Route**: Register in `src/router/index.jsx`

